What is Terraform in plain English?
Instead of clicking around in AWS console to create servers, you write code that describes what infrastructure you want.
Terraform reads that code and creates it. This is what "Infrastructure as Code" means.
At PIMCO they use this so every environment (dev, staging, prod) is identical and reproducible.
